attractive\" change Winner's views of her?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/24318/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"640483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Ren sets his sights on sucking Usui's mother's blood.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/24318/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"640484","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After trying to bite Usui, Karin feels like she betrayed him, and thinks that he hates her. Meanwhile, Ren is still after Usui's mom.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/24318/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"640485","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Karin finally realizes her feelings for Usui. Maki stays over at Karin's house for the first time. How will the family react?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/24318/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"640486","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The cultural festival is coming up, but it's not all fun and games for Karin. New problems arise when her gradma(who looks 16 years old) awakens from her coffen.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-03-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/24318/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"640487","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","langu